                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Part of why its broken is that the gcc and windows locale/time parsing libraries appear somewhat broken (windows worse than gcc but both questionable). Will need to test/analyze more/better to be sure (could be my misunderstanding).",
